# Deny-by-default: ignore everything, then explicitly allow the
# small set of files that make up the portable Claude Code config.
# This keeps secrets, transcripts, caches, and other local/private
# state out of the repo even if new files show up here later.
/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/syntax-coach/
